--- !u!114 &-3575889918730728097
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "\u2022 <b>Area Light</b> (\xD76) \u2014 Type: Spot, pointing down, 12 cm under the soffit \xB7 Intensity: 5.3 \xB7 Range: 30 \xB7 Spot angle (outer / inner): 170 / 169 \xB7 Colour (0\u2013255): 102, 204, 255 \xB7 Shadows: Soft \xB7 Notes: Cookie: <i>Lambert-Spot-170</i>\n\u2022 <b>Tube Light</b> (\xD76) \u2014 Type: Point, at the tube \xB7 Intensity: 0.9 \xB7 Range: 25 \xB7 Colour (0\u2013255): 102, 204, 255 \xB7 Shadows: None \xB7 Notes: the soft light all around the fixture, on the soffit\n\u2022 <b>Fog Spot</b> (\xD76) \u2014 Type: Spot, pointing down \xB7 Intensity: 3.5 \xB7 Range: 8 \xB7 Spot angle (outer / inner): 170 / 90 \xB7 Colour (0\u2013255): 92, 199, 255 \xB7 Shadows: Soft \xB7 Notes: lights only the fog (\xA7 10)\n\u2022 <b>Ceiling Light</b> \u2014 Type: Spot, down, inside the kiosk \xB7 Intensity: 6.4 \xB7 Range: 25 \xB7 Spot angle (outer / inner): 170 / 169 \xB7 Colour (0\u2013255): 255, 140, 56 \xB7 Shadows: Soft \xB7 Notes: Cookie: <i>Lambert-Spot-170</i>\n\u2022 <b>Window Beam</b> (\xD72) \u2014 Type: Spot, from inside, out through each window, slightly down \xB7 Intensity: 104 \xB7 Range: 13 \xB7 Spot angle (outer / inner): 30 / 18 \xB7 Colour (0\u2013255): 255, 140, 56 \xB7 Shadows: Soft \xB7 Notes: the warm shafts out of the windows\n\u2022 <b>Lamp Light</b> \u2014 Type: Spot, from the wall lamp, down and out \xB7 Intensity: 1.1 \xB7 Range: 18 \xB7 Spot angle (outer / inner): 120 / 50 \xB7 Colour (0\u2013255): 255, 179, 92 \xB7 Shadows: Soft \xB7 Notes: Cookie: <i>Lambert-Spot-170</i>\n\u2022 <b>Sign Glow</b> \u2014 Type: Spot, toward the camera, in front of the sign \xB7 Intensity: 0.42 \xB7 Range: 12 \xB7 Spot angle (outer / inner): 120 \xB7 Colour (0\u2013255): 217, 230, 255 \xB7 Shadows: None \xB7 Notes: the sign's halo\n\u2022 <b>Sodium Light</b> (\xD72) \u2014 Type: Spot, down, in each street lamp \xB7 Intensity: 3.3 \xB7 Range: 25 \xB7 Spot angle (outer / inner): 110 \xB7 Colour (0\u2013255): 255, 140, 51 \xB7 Shadows: None \xB7 Notes: far away; only the glow will read"
